user_stories.acceptance_criteria:
- [ ] GET /api/notifications?limit=50 returns { data: Notification[], unreadCount: number }
- [ ] Notifications are ordered by created_at DESC
- [ ] unreadCount is computed as count of notifications where created_at > readCursor.readAt (all unread if no cursor row exists)
- [ ] POST /api/notifications/read upserts the read cursor with the current timestamp and returns { ok: true }

